  "title": "Braised Beef",
  "description": "An elevated version of homestyle pot roast, this comforting dish is hearty and full of earthy richness and would pair well with mashed potatoes, buttery noodles or crusty bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Nicole McLaughlin"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-12-06T16:30:03-05:00",
